# Git LFS. Model weights and canonical prediction caches exceed GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit:
# oracle_ft_150M.pt is 566 MB, three LM checkpoints are 145 MB each, and the shipped ESM-2
# embedding cache is 273 MB. This matches the organisers' own ampdiffusion-starter-kit, which
# ships its checkpoint and APEX weights the same way and instructs users to run `git lfs pull`.
#
# GitHub Free/Pro allows 10 GB LFS storage and 10 GB bandwidth per month; this repository uses
# about 1.4 GB and roughly one clone, so it costs nothing.
*.pt      filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pth     filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pkl     filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.npy     filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.json.gz filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
